      "observed": "C13, the capacitor drawn across U8 (AP63203WU) BST (pin 6) and SW (pin 5), is labeled 100pF.",
      "expected": "The bootstrap capacitor of the AP63203WU buck is ~0.1 uF (100 nF) in the device's typical application; 100 pF is three orders of magnitude too small to hold the high-side gate-drive charge across a 1.1 MHz switching cycle.",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "schematic", "quote": "C13 100pF (power.kicad_sch, at U8 SW/BST bootstrap node)"},
